{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A Puzzle Unfolds to the Rhythm</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><br>Drill Beat</strong> is a <strong>puzzle-rhythm</strong> game where movement is driven by <strong>music</strong>. You control an <strong>animated drill bit</strong> that can only move <strong>to the beat</strong>, challenging you to <strong>time every step</strong>. Navigate through a series of <strong>intricate puzzles</strong>, avoid <strong>hazards</strong>, and find the <strong>best path forward</strong> as you collect <strong>golden cogs</strong> to unlock new stages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As you <strong>descend deeper</strong> into this <strong>mechanical world</strong>, the puzzles grow <strong>more complex</strong>, requiring a mix of <strong>rhythm, strategy, and quick thinking</strong>. With a unique blend of <strong>timing-based movement</strong> and <strong>puzzle-solving</strong>, Drill Beat delivers a <strong>fresh and engaging experience</strong> for players who enjoy both <strong>rhythm and logic-based challenges</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Can you make it to the bottom?</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3537890?t=1745961163","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537890/9b92d59382f932f3aef19448c1fa3c858042e09a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745961163","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537890/71ad8005b35eb2cee4850ed4565e2743ea897f0f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745961163","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537890/71ad8005b35eb2cee4850ed4565e2743ea897f0f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745961163","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"